Details of the Dispute Your records erroneously reflect late payments for XX/XX/XXXX, XX/XX/XXXX, XX/XX/XXXX, and XX/XX/XXXX. These notations are incorrect and unsupported by my payment history, as evidenced by the enclosed documentation. 
