11420537,2025-01-07,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX CA XXXX XXXX XXXX XX/XX/year> XXXXConsumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) ** XXXX XXXX XXXX Washington XXXX XXXX XXXX **Re : Dispute Resolution - Removal of Unverifiable Account from XXXX XXXX XXXX Dear Sir or Madam, I am writing to inform you of the successful dispute and removal of a {$5300.00} XXXX XXXX  charge-off account from my XXXX secondary credit report. The account was deleted as a result of the investigation conducted on XX/XX/year>. 

