11536728,2025-01-16,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"I recently reviewed my credit report and identified errors and discrepancies that require immediate correction. The following federal laws and regulations outline your responsibilities and my rights as a consumer, which I am invoking to request action on these matters. 

