I also reference 15 USC 1681 Section 604 ( a ) ( 2 ), which specifies that consumer reporting agencies may only furnish consumer reports with the explicit written consent of the consumer. I hereby revoke any and all consent ( verbal, non-verbal, written, or implied ) previously granted to XXXX, XXXX, or any furnisher of information. 

Furthermore, 15 USC 6802 ( b ) ( c ) requires financial institutions to inform consumers of their right to opt out of the disclosure of personal information. I was never informed of this right.

