Per 15 USC 1681s2 ( A ) ( 1 ) ( A ), furnishers of information must ensure that any information reported to consumer reporting agencies is accurate. Furthermore, under 15 USC 1681e, consumer reporting agencies must maintain reasonable procedures to avoid violations of consumer rights. It is clear that such procedures are not being followed. Lastly, under 12 CFR 1016.7, I am exercising my right to opt out of your reporting services. 

