11543061,2025-01-16,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"I am absolutely appalled and deeply disturbed to formally highlight a series of appalling concerns regarding the recent XXXX data breach and its devastating impact on my personal and financial information. As you may be aware, XXXX has negligently allowed a significant data breach to occur, exposing the highly sensitive personal information of countless consumers, myself included. Additionally, I am actively involved in the ongoing class action lawsuit arising from this egregious breach.

