Experian : XXXX late payment reported for XX/XX/XXXX. 
XXXX : XXXX late payment reported for XX/XX/XXXX. 
Inconsistent Dates and Reporting : The dates of the alleged late payments do not align with my records, which confirm that all payments were made on time. 
The payment history for this account shows inconsistencies between the credit bureaus, further raising doubts about the accuracy of the reported information. 
Supporting Evidence : I have attached copies of my payment records and the relevant sections of my credit report highlighting these discrepancies. These records clearly demonstrate that all payments were made on time and that there is no basis for the reported late payments. 
Legal Basis for Dispute : Under 15 USC 1681 ( a ) ( 2 ) ( A ) ( i ), consumer reports must not contain inaccurate or incomplete information. Furthermore, as per 15 USC 1681i, credit reporting agencies are required to conduct a thorough investigation of any disputed information and correct inaccuracies promptly. 
Additionally, I request that you provide the following : Documented Proof : Verifiable evidence supporting the claims of late payments, including specific dates, amounts, and any communication indicating that the payments were late. 
Investigation Process : A description of the procedure used to investigate and verify the accuracy of this account, including all steps taken and parties contacted during the investigation. 
