Requested Action : If the investigation confirms that the reported late payments are incorrect, I request that you : Update the account status to Paid As Agreed Never Late. 
Remove any late payment notations from my credit report. 
Failure to correct the inaccuracies or provide a satisfactory explanation within 30 days from the receipt of this letter will be considered a violation of the FCRA. I look forward to your prompt response and resolution of this matter. 
