11579326,2025-01-16,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Was not notified of investigation status or results,"XX/XX/XXXXXXXX  Subject : Request for Description of Investigation Process - Disputed Account on my Credit Report ( XXXX XXXX ) Dear CFPB, I am writing to formally dispute the reporting of late payments on my credit report for the account with XXXX XXXX ( Account # : XXXX ). After reviewing my credit report, I have identified significant discrepancies and errors in the reporting of this account that require immediate attention. This is my second formal dispute regarding this matter. 
