11645756,2025-01-18,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"I am filing this complaint against TransUnion for its failure to comply with the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), specifically regarding inaccurate accounts on my credit report. Despite my previous efforts to dispute these inaccuracies directly with TransUnion, they have failed to take appropriate corrective actions as mandated by law. 

