11737039,2025-01-25,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I am writing in regard to a debt from XXXX XXXX XXXX Account # XXXX, you have claimed I owe. I request your strict compliance with federal laws governing debt collection, credit reporting, and consumer protection. Please consider this letter as my formal dispute and request for validation of the alleged debt pursuant to the following statutes : XXXX. 15 U.S. Code 1692c Under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), I hereby request that all future communication regarding this matter be made in writing to the address provided above. Furthermore, any further attempts to contact me via phone, at my place of employment, or through third parties without my consent will be considered a violation of this statute.

