porting is illegal and subject to damages under the FCRA.

6. Failure to notify the consumer promptly Under the FDCPA, a debt buyer must notify the consumer of the transfer of ownership within a reasonable time. I did not receive any notification until the reporting had already been initiated, which violates my rights as a consumer.

